# Team Fund (MVP)

Admin manages Ranches Thunders fund tracker.

## Capabilities

- Seed / import historical offline balances as opening transactions
- Add expenses → balance updates immediately
- View running balance and history

## Contributions

- Admin may manually ask players to contribute **₹300** each when funds are low
- Sending the ask is **manual** in MVP (Admin taps send → push + WhatsApp)
- No automatic contribution debiting in MVP

## Permissions

- Admin: mutate fund / expenses / asks
- Player: view balance and own contribution status (if tracked)
